Try atari.archive.umich.edu in Games/  It's listed under nethack31.zoo.

However, this is the buggy version.  The update should be up sometime soon.
It's missing the Wizard help file and the score table is screwed up. (It
puts you at the #1 slot no matter what your score).

But buggy nethack is better than no nethack at all...

Keep in mind that you need at least 2 megs and a hard drive.  Unless you
find a way to pfx-pack it.  Apparently this is the only packer that will
work on it.

